# drive.press with a mod (docs/port/MODS.md 8; tools/port/mods_synth.py's colour set): track 1's ground magenta, the
# track's file read from the mods' region of the cartridge, converted and set up as the cartridge's files are. The
# ground fills the picture's lower part.
# until: 0x400000:900
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
# args: --mods-dir mods/colour --screenshot-at 1600 --screenshot mods_colour.png
# check: tools/port/mods_check.py log mods_colour.game.log --has "mods: 1 on: Magenta ground 1.0 (1 file)" --has "of the cartridge's files replaced" --lacks refused
# check: tools/port/mods_check.py shot mods_colour.png --rgb 255,0,255 --min 5000
# check: tools/port/synth_shot.py mods_colour.png 1
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select: track 0
23 A           # the car select; the race starts at about 23.6 s and its countdown runs 3.5 s
27 A 20        # gas for 20 s
32 STICKRIGHT 1.5
36 STICKLEFT 1.5
47 B 3         # the brake
